{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">尊敬的用户</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">您好！</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">中央气象台4月11日发布大风橙色预警：</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">11日8时至12日8时，新疆东部和南疆盆地、青海北部、甘肃北部和东部、宁夏、陕西中北部、内蒙古大部及东北地区中南部、华北、黄淮、江淮、江汉、江南北部、四川盆地东部等地部分地区有5～7级大风，阵风8～10级，其中，内蒙古中西部、河北北部等地局地阵风风力可达12～13级。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">12日8时至13日8时，新疆东部、陕西北部、内蒙古中东部及东北地区中南部、华北、黄淮、江淮东部、江汉东部等地部分地区有6～8级大风，阵风9～10级，其中，内蒙古中东部、山西北部、河北北部、北京西部和北部山区等地局地阵风风力可达12～13级。 受以上大风恶劣天气影响，相关区域快件<span class=\"text-message-baike\" data-uuid=\"159fca32-447f-4257-9cea-9d483a146279\" data-baike-item=\"%7B%22begin%22%3A371%2C%22deepLink%22%3A%22jdme%3A%2F%2Frn%2F201909020601%3FrouteTag%3Dpedia_item%26rnStandalone%3D2%26label%3D%25E9%2585%258D%25E9%2580%2581%25E6%2597%25B6%25E6%2595%2588%26channel%3D2%26identify%3Dname%22%2C%22end%22%3A375%2C%22link%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fjoyspace.jd.com%2Fknowledges%2Fitem%2F%25E9%2585%258D%25E9%2580%2581%25E6%2597%25B6%25E6%2595%2588%3Fchannel%3D2%26identify%3Dname%22%2C%22nativeDeepLink%22%3A%22jdme%3A%2F%2Fjm%2Fbiz%2FjoyPedia%3Fmparam%3D%257B%2522url%2522%253A%2522https%253A%252F%252Fjoyspace.jd.com%252Fknowledges%252Fitem%252F%2525E9%252585%25258D%2525E9%252580%252581%2525E6%252597%2525B6%2525E6%252595%252588%253Fchannel%253D2%2526identify%253Dname%2526popup%253Dtrue%2522%257D%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22%E9%85%8D%E9%80%81%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%22%7D\">配送时效</span>将受到一定影响，我司会密切关注天气情况，合理调配资源，确保快件<span class=\"text-message-baike\" data-uuid=\"d33d5102-6413-4eba-b33c-eedccfd3c81a\" data-baike-item=\"%7B%22begin%22%3A406%2C%22deepLink%22%3A%22jdme%3A%2F%2Frn%2F201909020601%3FrouteTag%3Dpedia_item%26rnStandalone%3D2%26label%3D%25E5%25AE%2589%25E5%2585%25A8%26channel%3D2%26identify%3Dname%22%2C%22end%22%3A408%2C%22link%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fjoyspace.jd.com%2Fknowledges%2Fitem%2F%25E5%25AE%2589%25E5%2585%25A8%3Fchannel%3D2%26identify%3Dname%22%2C%22nativeDeepLink%22%3A%22jdme%3A%2F%2Fjm%2Fbiz%2FjoyPedia%3Fmparam%3D%257B%2522url%2522%253A%2522https%253A%252F%252Fjoyspace.jd.com%252Fknowledges%252Fitem%252F%2525E5%2525AE%252589%2525E5%252585%2525A8%253Fchannel%253D2%2526identify%253Dname%2526popup%253Dtrue%2522%257D%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%22%7D\">安全</span>送达。如给您带来不便敬请谅解，谢谢! </span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">2025年4月11日</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content02621", "contentTitle": "大风恶劣天气影响快递时效的温馨提醒", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1744347260000, "id": 5807, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1744347376846.jpg", "updateTime": 1744348874000}}